COMPILATION OF: E46N3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N3

   1 a 0000 E46N3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] FILE SKIP BEFORE A VARYING VARIABLE.
   4 a 0006      A SKIP is a control item and a variable is an operand;
   5 a 0006      [C293] says mixing the two classes has never been
   6 a 0006      accepted on the named-file route, and this is the
   7 a 0006      first time DR is asked directly. */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying;
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N3OUT DAT');
  10 c 0023   put file(outf) skip list(v);
  11 c 0040   close file(outf);
  12 a 0046 end E46N3;

CODE SIZE = 0049
DATA AREA = 001E
FREE SYMS = 38A8
END  COMPILATION
